-- SaaS Phase 2: who created, sold or approved a row must be in that row's dealership. Same pattern
-- as 00072: each key is replaced under its own name, keeps its delete action, and validates without
-- blocking writes. With one dealership every existing row already satisfies it.
-- Left as they are: audit_logs.user_id (platform events have no dealership) and
-- tenant_members.user_id (kept in step by sync_profile_membership).
-- Consequence: a person with authored records cannot be moved to another dealership by accident.
-- Rollback: supabase/rollbacks/00076_tenant_actor_keys_down.sql

